# Ops And Release

- Update `README.md`, `docs/beta/RUNBOOK.md`, `docs/beta/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md`, `.env.example`, or `SECURITY.md` when deployment, environment, backup, recovery, CI, auth, or provider behavior changes.
- Never commit `.env`, real tokens, private Telegram IDs, raw backups, local DB files, raw uploads, or generated audit artifacts.
- Keep GitHub CI, secret scanning, dependency review, CodeQL, and security docs aligned with the actual release process.
- Prefer reversible operational changes and clear recovery commands for the Windows private-beta environment.
- Before release work, run the full backend, migration, frontend, preflight, and quality-audit checks documented in `AGENTS.md`.

## Useful Checks

```powershell
python -m ruff check .
python -m pytest -q
alembic upgrade head
cd web; npm test; npm run build
python scripts/preflight_check.py --db --schema
python scripts/quality_audit.py --limit 10 --delay-s 0
```
